15.2.m:
Durvāsas said:
“Do you not know Durvāsas? Release these finest horses;
and you and this wife of yours, carry me on your own chariot!”

Within the outer grove he worshipped him in like manner;
having personally washed his feet, Hari, the purifier of the universe,
placed upon his head the water from washing the brahmin’s feet.
